Polygonal plot with approximately five metres of northern road frontage and a maximum depth of 14 metres. Registered acquisition describes a four-storey shophouse numbered 56/16; the survey includes a roof terrace. SAM reports orange planning zoning.

Material access disclosure: SAM reports easements over Chanote titles 12262 and 12718 and Nor Sor 3 Kor 5169 benefiting the property for pedestrian and vehicle access, electricity, water and other utilities. Verify registered instruments, scope and actual access before offering. The sale plot itself has Chanote 12449; the access documents refer to separate land.

From Kamala toward Wat Suwan Khiri Wong on Phra Barami Road (Highway 4029), pass the temple school, turn right at the temple junction into Phisit Karani Road, then right into Ratchapathanuson Road for approximately 290 metres. Turn left into Soi Fire Station for 70 metres, then right to the end; the property is on the left.

Seventeen source images show the exterior, rooms, bathrooms, roof terrace, street access, plot plans and map. Displayed dates include 16 November 2022 and 16 November 2023. Inspect current condition, especially roof terrace drainage, walls, electrical and plumbing systems, as well as building registration and additions.

SAM showed direct-purchase status and this price on 11 September 2026. Contact 02-686-1888, sales@sam.or.th or LINE @samline, quoting 8Z6607, to confirm availability, price, viewing, easements and terms.

